From fa98a618b749ae831399cd9c612e97682242ce40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Pelloni <robertpelloni@users.noreply.gitlab.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 21:07:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix: scratchpad timeout, UIAutomation Int32 overflow,
 repomap blocking

- Register scratchpad and core I/O tools (bash/ls/read/write/grep/find/repomap) in Go-native tool registry so POST /api/agent/tool resolves them without upstream Node
- Register 9 additional tools (get_system_stats, apply_search_replace, launch_webview, add_bookmark, cloud_troubleshoot, generate_devops_pipeline, jira_create_issue, confluence_search, download_llamafile)
- Add file walk cap (MaxFiles*10) to repomap to prevent kernel blocking on large repos
- Add context.Context to repomap.Generate with cancellation check during walk
- Fix UIAutomation Convert-Bounds NaN/Infinity/Int32 overflow with guards and clamping
- Fix stale mcp.jsonc supervisor path
