Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat: kernel watchdog with auto-restart and Windows Task
 Scheduler installer

- kernel-watchdog.ps1: polls /health every 30s, restarts after 3 consecutive failures
- install-watchdog.ps1: registers as Windows Scheduled Task (runs at logon)
